<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Глава 5. Массивы и срезы on GoToGo</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/</link><description>Recent content in Глава 5. Массивы и срезы on GoToGo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Массивы и срезы: основы</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/01-static-dynamic/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/01-static-dynamic/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="массивы" class=link_owner>
 Массивы
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bc%d0%b0%d1%81%d1%81%d0%b8%d0%b2%d1%8b" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Массив — последовательность элементов &lt;strong>фиксированной длины&lt;/strong> одного типа. Размер — часть типа: &lt;code>[3]int&lt;/code> и &lt;code>[5]int&lt;/code> — разные типы.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// нулевые значения: [0 0 0 0 0]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;Go&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;is&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;fast&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">c&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">...&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// компилятор считает длину&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// &amp;#34;is&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Массив копируется при присваивании и передаче в функцию — значение, не ссылка.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">y&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// копия&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">y&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">99&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 1 — x не изменился&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="срезы" class=link_owner>
 Срезы
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7%d1%8b" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Срез — &lt;strong>дескриптор&lt;/strong> для сегмента массива: три поля &lt;code>(ptr, len, cap)&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Память и производительность срезов</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/02-memory/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/02-memory/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="внутренняя-структура-среза" class=link_owner>
 Внутренняя структура среза
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b2%d0%bd%d1%83%d1%82%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%bd%d1%8f%d1%8f-%d1%81%d1%82%d1%80%d1%83%d0%ba%d1%82%d1%83%d1%80%d0%b0-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>┌─────────┬─────┬─────┐
│ *array │ len │ cap │
└─────────┴─────┴─────┘
 │
 ▼
┌────┬────┬────┬────┬────┐
│ 10 │ 20 │ 30 │ 40 │ 50 │
└────┴────┴────┴────┴────┘
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;code>len&lt;/code> — количество доступных элементов.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;code>cap&lt;/code> — размер выделенного массива от начала среза до конца.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h2 id="рост-при-append" class=link_owner>
 Рост при append
 &lt;a href="#%d1%80%d0%be%d1%81%d1%82-%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%b8-append" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Когда &lt;code>len == cap&lt;/code>, &lt;code>append&lt;/code> выделяет &lt;strong>новый массив&lt;/strong> и копирует данные:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">8&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">prev&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">prev&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;len=%d cap: %d → %d\n&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">),&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">prev&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// cap: 0→1, 1→2, 2→4, 4→8&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Стратегия удвоения даёт амортизированную стоимость &lt;code>O(1)&lt;/code> на один &lt;code>append&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Эффективная обработка больших данных</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/03-bulk/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-05/03-bulk/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="потоковая-обработка" class=link_owner>
 Потоковая обработка
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bf%d0%be%d1%82%d0%be%d0%ba%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%b0%d1%8f-%d0%be%d0%b1%d1%80%d0%b0%d0%b1%d0%be%d1%82%d0%ba%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Вместо загрузки всех данных в память — обрабатывай по частям:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;bufio&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;os&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">processLines&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">filename&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">error&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">os&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Open&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">filename&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">nil&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">defer&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Close&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">scanner&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">bufio&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">NewScanner&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">scanner&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Scan&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">line&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">scanner&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Text&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">process&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">line&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// O(1) памяти на строку&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">scanner&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Err&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="переиспользование-срезов" class=link_owner>
 Переиспользование срезов
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bf%d0%b5%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b8%d1%81%d0%bf%d0%be%d0%bb%d1%8c%d0%b7%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5-%d1%81%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b7%d0%be%d0%b2" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// Плохо: новая аллокация на каждой итерации&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">_&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">chunk&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">range&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">chunks&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">transform&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">chunk&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// Хорошо: переиспользуем буфер&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1024&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">_&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">chunk&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">range&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">chunks&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// сброс длины без освобождения памяти&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">transform&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">chunk&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">process&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">buf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="параллельная-обработка" class=link_owner>
 Параллельная обработка
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bf%d0%b0%d1%80%d0%b0%d0%bb%d0%bb%d0%b5%d0%bb%d1%8c%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%8f-%d0%be%d0%b1%d1%80%d0%b0%d0%b1%d0%be%d1%82%d0%ba%d0%b0" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;sync&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">parallelProcess&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">workers&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">chunkSize&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">workers&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">/&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">workers&lt;/span>
